{"from": "claim:jn-02-19-temple-saying", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mk-14-58-destroy-temple-saying", "note": "John 2:19 presents the temple saying as Jesus' own words during the temple confrontation at the first Passover; Mark 14:58 reports it as witness testimony at the trial before the high priest in the final week, with 'made with hands' / 'not made with hands' qualifiers."}
{"from": "passage:jn-02-17", "type": "related_to", "to": "text:psalm-69-9", "note": "John 2:17 quotes Psalm 69:9 (WEB: 'Zeal for your house will eat me up'). Cross-reference, not evidence (docs/calibration.md)."}
